#: krunnerapp.cpp:405
msgid ""
"Could not log out properly.\n"
"The session manager cannot be contacted. You can try to force a shutdown by "
"pressing Ctrl+Alt+Backspace; note, however, that your current session will "
"not be saved with a forced shutdown."
msgstr ""
"Impossible de se desconnectar corrèctament.\n"
"Lo gestionari de sesilhas a pas pogut èsser contactat. Podètz ensajar de "
"forçar l'arèst en picant simultanèament sus las tòcas Ctrl, Alt e "
"Correccion. Nòta : vòstra sesilha correnta serà pas enregistrada aprèp un "
"arèst forçat"

